#: ../../source/is-resolvable_README.md:8
msgid ""
"A [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) module to check if a given module ID is "
"resolvable with "
"[`require()`](https://nodejs.org/api/globals.html#globals_require)"
msgstr ""

